  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Let any point on it is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also given line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Let any point on it be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now shortest distance between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>29</mn></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>",
